 SG_ VSM_State : 0|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" AIM
 SG_ Inv_PWM_Freq : 8|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "kHz" AIM
 SG_ Inverter_State : 16|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" AIM
 SG_ Relay_1 : 24|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" AIM
